  },
  "content": {
    "paragraphs": [
      {
        "id": "p1",
        "order": 1,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "id": "s1",
            "text": "The strange animal in the ice looked like it was sleeping."
          },
          {
            "id": "s2",
            "text": "Ten-year-old Kostia Khudi and his brother had never seen anything like it."
          },
          {
            "id": "s3",
            "text": "Their father, a reindeer herder 1 named Yuri Khudi, went to ask a friend for advice."
          },
          {
            "id": "s4",
            "text": "But when he returned, the body had disappeared."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "order": 2,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "id": "s5",
            "text": "Yuri soon found the animal’s body leaning against a store in a nearby town."
          },
          {
            "id": "s6",
            "text": "While he was away, his cousin had sold it to the store owner."
          },
          {
            "id": "s7",
            "text": "Dogs had eaten part of the tail and ear."
          },
          {
            "id": "s8",
            "text": "But it was still in almost “as close to perfect condition as you can imagine,” says scientist Daniel Fisher."
          },
          {
            "id": "s9",
            "text": "The police came to help."
          },
          {
            "id": "s10",
            "text": "The body was taken by helicopter to a museum."
          },
          {
            "id": "s11",
            "text": "The animal was a baby mammoth from the Ice Age."
          },
          {
            "id": "s12",
            "text": "It was female, so the scientists named it after Yuri’s wife."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "order": 3,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "id": "s13",
            "text": "From Siberia, the mammoth was sent to the Netherlands and Japan."
          },
          {
            "id": "s14",
            "text": "Scientists there studied it in detail."
          },
          {
            "id": "s15",
            "text": "Studies of her teeth and tusks showed she was just one month old when she died."
          },
          {
            "id": "s16",
            "text": "Research has also shown us the sequence of events that led to her death."
          },
          {
            "id": "s17",
            "text": "Lyuba fell and died near a muddy river."
          },
          {
            "id": "s18",
            "text": "The mud 2 helped keep her body frozen until she was found, 40,000 years later."
          },
          {
            "id": "s19",
            "text": "Scientists hope that further studies will help explain how mammoths like Lyuba lived."
          },
          {
            "id": "s20",
            "text": "They also want to know why mammoths became extinct."
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
